{
  "id": "311201",
  "resourceId": 112,
  "name": "毒蛇",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c112_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c112_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "你想知道我在想什麼嗎？\n讓你看看？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "好想跟親愛的一起拍情侶照～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你覺得怎麼樣？\n這副耳機是不是跟我很搭？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "想不想看點有趣的東西？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，我好看嗎～？\n呵呵，那你能幫我拍一張嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～過來一下。\n我幫你畫上滿滿的顏色♡",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，能用這個幫我傳一則訊息嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，我的泳裝好看嗎？\n這可是我用心挑的～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵呵，像這樣邊聽音樂邊塗鴉，\n有種變回小孩子的感覺～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "為了和你一起玩，我可是取消了約會，不信你看？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "把手機背景\n換成我們的合照吧～好不好？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～你不好奇我在聽什麼歌嗎？\n……要不要一起聽？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "我隱藏的祕密，只給你看哦♡",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "一起在海邊創造屬於我們兩人的回憶吧！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "好想在你心裡寫滿我的名字♡\n……可以嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你傳給我的訊息，我都存下來了，你看。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "這套泳裝不防水～\n你要不要檢查一下……？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "我是專屬你的毒蛇貓貓～\n喵嗚♡",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你在做什麼？我好無聊。\n你打算一直把我丟在這嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～你要把我一個人留在這裡嗎～？\n皮膚都要曬黑了～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "如果你繼續像這樣丟著我不管～\n我可是會到處亂塗亂畫喔？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～真奇怪。一直被你丟在這不管真的好煩哦。\n不過看到你的臉，又覺得很有趣。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～你還是被我迷住了吧？\n你一直盯著我的臉看呢！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "既然親愛的丟著我不管～\n壞貓咪只好在你的房間裡\n到～處留下地盤標記了♡",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "哇～這裡比外緣區更好欸～\n好想要啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你也穿上泳裝吧～\n我們一起去泳池約會♡",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "啊哈♡要在哪裡塗鴉呢～\n哎呀，你聽到啦？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "我們隊長說了，即使誘惑也要將你帶到時尚吧。\n我可以誘惑你嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "難得有機會，我要跟親愛的拍好多合照～\n所以說親愛的，你再靠過來一點～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "只要把我的名字寫在這裡，這些就全都變成我的了嗎？\n那如果寫在你身上……親愛的也會變成我的嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "這個地方都是親愛的所有吧？\n只要擁有你，就能擁有這裡了吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～我們以後有機會再穿泳裝約會吧♡\n提前約好了哦！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～要不要一起去散步？\n邊走邊聽點好聽的歌？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "只要親愛的喜歡，我可以變成美麗的蚺蛇，也可以變成危險的毒蛇。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～這個夏天，你是我的♡ 別忘了喲！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "喵嗚♡我是聽著嗨歌跑來找你的毒蛇貓貓～\n要好好疼愛我唷～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "你希望我變得更強？為什麼～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "你還好嗎？再這樣下去，你真的可能會被我吃掉的哦～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，謝謝♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，不錯。辛苦了～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "哇，謝謝你～再拍一張做紀念吧～嗯？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的這次也很賣力喔～要不要給你誇誇？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "你對我這麼好，小心寵壞我哦？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～你怎麼對我這麼好～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "一直接受你的好意……會讓我養成壞習慣的♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "這些都是送給我的嗎？我好喜歡～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "啊哈，巧合巧合～我也想過要給你這個呢♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "你一直這樣什麼都給我，叫我怎麼辦嘛～\n比起單純的收禮物，其實我更喜歡搶別人的東西♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "無論何時，收到禮物總令人開心。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，謝謝你～我要拍照好好炫耀一下♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你的品味還是一樣優秀呢♡\n我收下囉～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，親愛的♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵，情敵們會嫉妒我的吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵，我要在這裡全寫上名字～\n不准任何人拿走。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你要小心呀。\n一直對我這麼好，小心被我吃乾抹淨哦？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "你還蠻懂少女的心意嘛？\n再這樣下去，我也快要陷進去啦♡",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "好想把親愛的從頭到腳，都塗上我的顏色。\n這樣就誰也搶不走了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "想和親愛的關係更進一步，\n該怎麼做呀？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～你再這樣，我可要把你帶走了～",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "我可是個危險的女人喔。\n親愛的老是對我這麼好……\n小心我喵嗚♡一聲把你吃掉唷～",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "本來想讓你愛上我，把你迷得神魂顛倒，\n這樣下去反而是我要陷進去了呢？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵，我們之間又多了一個小祕密呢！\n我很高興♡",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼辦？我一直一直……好想霸佔親愛的……\n可不可以寫上名字，說你是我的？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "這麼想和我一起去嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，看來你又想見我了呀？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "哼哼～好啊，我要邊走邊聽歌～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～親愛的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，你叫我嗎～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "喵嗚♡",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "人家不喜歡走路啦。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "有還不錯的拍攝點嗎～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "要不要去塗鴉一下呢～？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "哇，有可怕的東西欸。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的～我好怕哦～♪",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，礙事的傢伙來了呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "啊～好可怕～太可怕了，所以要把它們全部殺光～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……可不能把泳裝弄壞。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "要不要開心地大畫特畫？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～開槍次數太多會弄壞人家的美甲啦。",
      "animation": "idle"
